    "name": "headspin-migration-skill",
    "description": "Migrate test automation from HeadSpin to TestMu AI (formerly LambdaTest) in any language or framework. Covers HeadSpin per-device Appium and Selenium endpoints (token in URL), headspin: capabilities, User Flows, the automation-config API, hs connect browser for Playwright and Puppeteer. Use this whenever someone wants to move, switch, port, migrate or point tests from HeadSpin to TestMu AI or LambdaTest, asks what the TestMu or LT:Options equivalent is for a capability, config, CLI flag or API from HeadSpin, mentions headspin.io, /v0/TOKEN/wd/hub, headspin:capture, headspin:testName, headspin:selector, headspin:quitSession, automation-config, hs connect browser, or wants a migration plan, estimate, PR or checklist for a repo currently on HeadSpin, even without the word migrate.\n",
